ir numeric literals match.","required_change":"Constrain the compared quantities to a common compatible unit or implement explicit unit-aware conversion before applying the less-than and equality tests.","regression_guard":"Preserve the false-status applicability condition and the requirement that the selected design scantling equals the classification-society-required scantling after unit normalization.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"},{"category":"CARDINALITY","location":"gs:TRF032NotIceStrengthenedBranch / nltl:selectedDesignScantling","problem":"The candidate does not constrain selectedDesignScantling to exactly one QuantityValue with exactly one numericValue. The SPARQL constraint uses NOT EXISTS and passes whenever any selected value matches the classification numeric value, so multiple selected values including nonmatching values can satisfy the rule.","required_change":"Add an exact-one selectedDesignScantling quantity shape, including exactly one numericValue, and make the conditional check require the sole selected quantity to equal the classification-required quantity.","regression_guard":"Preserve the conditional violation when the selected design scantling is missing or does not equal the required classification-society scantling.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"}],"generator_elapsed_ms":26176.453,"validator_elapsed_ms":17363.352}
